# TinyOS runs entirely in the browser and needs no backend, keys or secrets.
# This file is here so the shape of the environment is documented.
#
# Nothing is required to run `npm run dev` or `npm run build`.
# If you later add a service (e.g. a mailing list or analytics), put its
# public, non-secret value here and the real value in the Netlify dashboard.

VITE_APP_NAME=
